ine.&nbsp; The bottom number is likely too low, but we will deal with that on an individual level once we have candidates.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div class=\"x_elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"x_elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Gina - please post the position.</div><div class=\"x_elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"x_elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Mark</div><div class=\"x_elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div id=\"x_appendonsend\"></div><hr tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:98%\"><div id=\"x_divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b> Marisa Gibaud &lt;marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, July 21, 2026 8:17 AM<br><b>To:</b> Mark Weisman &lt;Mark.Weisman@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Erin Cowder &lt;Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Gina Vieira &lt;Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Filippa Etherton &lt;Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Kristin Chaillou &lt;kristin.chaillou@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Tara Pieroni &lt;Tara.Pieroni@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: New Position Email - JC 1341 Senior Network Engineer</font> <div>&nbsp;</div></div><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"}