indowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">$110,843.20 </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">($53.29/hr) - </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">$171,808.00 </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">($82.60/hr)</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FLSA:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Exempt (salaried)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">License:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">None</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">N</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1.00</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Network/Client Support Manager</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">While I understand the perspective that the skills required are industry-agnostic, we have aligned the role with our market methodology. The survey you provided can be used as one component of that methodology, but it would not serve as the sole data point.&nbsp; As noted previously, we are geographically constrained and have adjusted our benchmarking accordingly. The organizations that typically participate in the IT specific survey would include national top payors (e.g., Deloitte, Apple, Google) which are generally not the companies with which we compete for talent.&nbsp;&nbsp; We would need to apply the correct data filters to the survey data to get a benchmarking number more aligned with our compensation philosophy.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">I also understand that this role is part of a succession planning strategy; however, this would be the first step in that process. A structured ramp-up plan could help align the role’s growth trajectory with the targeted position by establishing clear milestones. It would also help identify any compensation changes, beyond merit increases, that may be needed along the way to align with additional responsibilities.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Mark Weisman &lt;Mark.Weisman@tidalhealth.org&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Monday, July 20, 2026 2:44 PM<br><b>To:</b> Marisa Gibaud &lt;marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Erin Cowder &lt;Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Gina Vieira &lt;Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Filippa Etherton &lt;Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Kristin Chaillou &lt;kristin.chaillou@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Tara Pieroni &lt;Tara.Pieroni@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Re: New Position Email - JC 1341 Senior Network Engineer</span></p></div></div><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Hi Marisa,</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">It comes from the: 2025 North America Mercer/Gartner IT Jobs and Skills Survey Report.&nbsp; This position is industry agnostic because an internet packet is an internet packet, regardless if you are in healthcare, banking, or agriculture.&nbsp; These are infrastructure people and there is no industry specialization.</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">P5 is the correct level.&nbsp; This is a senior technical person who must be an expert at network architecture.&nbsp; Our network support specialist is the entry level.&nbsp; Network engineer is the mid-level.&nbsp; This is the senior, who will have the technical chops equal to Brad Taylor.&nbsp; Brad cannot continue to work 70+ hours per week and never go away on vacation.&nbsp; As he approaches 70, he will eventually slow down and we must be prepared.</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Based on the industry knowledge from Randy, Brad, and me, we need to be at the range I indicated below.&nbsp; We understand what we are looking for and what it will take to land that person.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Mark</span></p><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"98%\" align=\"center\"></div><div id=\"x_x_divRplyFwdMsg\"><p class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> Marisa Gibaud &lt;<a href=\"mailto:marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org\">marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Monday, July 20, 2026 1:17 PM<br><b>To:</b> Mark Weisman &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Mark.Weisman@tidalhealth.org\">Mark.Weisman@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;; Erin Cowder &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org\">Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;; Gina Vieira &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org\">Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Filippa Etherton &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org\">Filippa.Etherton@ti