">Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;; Kristin Chaillou &lt;<a href=\"mailto:kristin.chaillou@tidalhealth.org\">kristin.chaillou@tidalhealth.org</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Re: New Position Email - JC 1341 Senior Network Engineer</span></p></div><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Hi Erin,</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">We work 24/7, 365 in IT.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&#128517;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">But seriously, the position is the normal day shift with night/weekends/holidays as needed.</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">I need a favor....&nbsp; That salary is too low and needs to be reassessed, please.&nbsp; You are showing me numbers that are $50k lower than Mercer, which is from 83 organizations.&nbsp; Why?&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">This position should start at $150,000 with a mid at $185,000.&nbsp; That is what we put in our budget and is what it will take to fill this position on the Eastern Shore.&nbsp; Not clear if the Eastern Shore even has someone like this so we are likely recruiting for someone to move here.</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Mark</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"1974\" height=\"1419\" id=\"x_x_x_Picture_x0020_1\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:2|T:2\" src=\"cid:image001.png@01DD18E9.66AF3D30\" style=\"width:20.5625in; height:14.7812in\"></span></p><div class=\"x_x_MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"98%\" ali