p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Network/Client Support Manager</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Senior Network Engineer is responsible for the design, implementation, optimization, and operational support of a large-scale, highly available healthcare network spanning multiple hospitals, ambulatory sites, and data centers. This role supports a mission-critical environment with approximately 30,000 networked devices across 3 hospitals and 90 ambulatory sites within a 90-mile radius. The engineer will provide expert-level support for routed and switched networks, data center infrastructure, WAN connectivity, wireless systems, firewalls, and unified communications, ensuring high availability, security, and performance in a regulated healthcare setting.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or equivalent experience.</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Cisco certifications such as CCNP, CCIE, or equivalent preferred.</span></li></ul><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Seven (7) years of progressive experience in enterprise network engineering.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Extensive hands-on experience with Cisco networking technologies in large environments.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Expertise in routing and switching, including BGP, OSPF, and EIGRP.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience supporting large-scale WANs and multi-site healthcare or similarly regulated environments.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience with Cisco data center products (e.g. Nexus, Cisco ACI) preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Cloud networking (e.g. AWS, Azure) preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience with security products, especially firewalls preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience in healthcare IT environments preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Familiarity with network automation, monitoring tools, and ITIL practices preferred.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span></li><li class=\"x_x_xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></